        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">{{{icon "bolt" "w-5 h-5 text-al-orange shrink-0 mt-0.5"}}}Loss of high-value equine assets</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">{{{icon "horseshoe" "w-5 h-5 text-al-orange shrink-0 mt-0.5"}}}Shortened competitive careers</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">{{{icon "calculator" "w-5 h-5 text-al-orange shrink-0 mt-0.5"}}}Reduced earnings potential</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/the-science/kidney-homeostasis" class="btn-primary mt-8">See Kidney Homeostasis</a>
    </div>
